==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la}} ''[[succedere]]'', to succeed in

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|En-us-successive.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Coming one after the other in a [[series]].
#: ''They had won the title for five successive years.''
# Of, or relating to a [[succession]].

